      "answer": "The WikiEval dataset was constructed by selecting 50 Wikipedia pages covering events since early 2022, prioritizing those with recent edits. For each page, ChatGPT was used to generate a question based on the introductory section, following specific rules. ChatGPT also generated answers using the context. Human annotators then evaluated the answers and contexts along three quality dimensions: faithfulness, answer relevance, and context relevance. For context relevance, back-links were scraped to add related but less relevant information. Disagreements among annotators were resolved through discussion [1][3][4].",
